👑🧠 Birbal and the Three Dolls (Raw Story)

One day, a craftsman brought three beautiful dolls to Emperor Akbar.

They looked exactly the same.

The craftsman said, “One of these dolls is the best, but you must find out which one.”

Akbar was puzzled and asked Birbal for help.

Birbal examined the dolls carefully.

He took a thin wire and inserted it into the ear of the first doll.

It came out from the other ear.

He tried the second doll.

The wire came out from its mouth.

Then he tried the third doll.

The wire stayed inside.

Birbal said, “The third doll is the best.”

Akbar asked, “Why?”

Birbal explained, “The first doll forgets everything. The second repeats everything. But the third keeps things safely inside.”

Akbar agreed.

💖 Moral:

A wise person listens and keeps secrets when needed.
